1
00:00:03,083 --> 00:00:04,291
It’s over.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,208
He's safe now.

3
00:00:11,291 --> 00:00:12,583
I surrender.

4
00:00:12,583 --> 00:00:14,916
Please, just let my family go...

5
00:00:14,916 --> 00:00:17,750
Do it yourself, and
I’ll let your family live.

6
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,416
That was your last choice?

7
00:00:34,416 --> 00:00:38,083
A warrior can die,
but never be humiliated!

8
00:00:38,583 --> 00:00:40,958
Then die.

9
00:00:42,708 --> 00:00:45,291
My lord, are you alright?

10
00:00:46,583 --> 00:00:47,833
I’m fine.

11
00:00:51,875 --> 00:00:55,375
Get over here and
clean up these bodies.

12
00:00:55,375 --> 00:00:58,708
Thank you for
saving my life, Godfather.

13
00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:01,916
We’re family now.

14
00:01:01,916 --> 00:01:03,916
No need for thanks.

15
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,166
Everyone!

16
00:01:07,166 --> 00:01:09,541
Spread the word, 
 tonight the Morellan family

17
00:01:09,541 --> 00:01:11,875
feasts in honor of the Godfather!

18
00:01:12,416 --> 00:01:13,583
- Yes, my lord!
- Yes, my lord!

19
00:01:17,875 --> 00:01:19,208
What are you staring at?

20
00:01:19,208 --> 00:01:20,750
Fallen for me already?

21
00:01:22,666 --> 00:01:24,583
I’m just thinking...

22
00:01:24,583 --> 00:01:27,125
our own victory party,
and we’re ghosting everybody.

23
00:01:27,166 --> 00:01:28,916
Won’t my father be pissed?

24
00:01:30,333 --> 00:01:31,583
Don’t worry.

25
00:01:31,583 --> 00:01:33,208
I’ve got you.
